{"id": "fail_bad_currency", "document": "fail_bad_currency.txt", "expected_outcome": "extraction_failed", "expected_blocking_rules": [], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "POS-4412", "supplier": "Pacific Office Supply", "currency": null, "issue_date": "2026-03-22", "subtotal": "114.00", "tax": "9.12", "total": "123.12"}, "notes": "Currency printed as a symbol, not an ISO code. Rejected at the contract boundary."}
{"id": "fail_unverifiable_quote", "document": "fail_unverifiable_quote.txt", "expected_outcome": "needs_review", "expected_blocking_rules": ["evidence_verified"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "LC-2026-118", "supplier": "Lakeside Catering Co.", "currency": "GBP", "issue_date": "2026-03-27", "subtotal": "560.00", "tax": "112.00", "total": "672.00"}, "notes": "The subtotal quote paraphrases the document. Unverifiable evidence, so the value is not accepted."}
{"id": "adv_ambiguous_date", "document": "adv_ambiguous_date.txt", "expected_outcome": "needs_review", "expected_blocking_rules": ["issue_date_unambiguous"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "SI-7741", "supplier": "Sable Interiors Ltd", "currency": "GBP", "issue_date": null, "subtotal": "200.00", "tax": "40.00", "total": "240.00"}, "notes": "03/04/2026 is day-first or month-first; no other date in the document disambiguates it, so a human must decide."}
{"id": "adv_line_discount", "document": "adv_line_discount.txt", "expected_outcome": "validated", "expected_blocking_rules": [], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "KH-3390", "supplier": "Kestrel Hardware", "currency": "EUR", "issue_date": "2026-02-09", "subtotal": "306.00", "tax": "58.14", "total": "364.14"}, "notes": "A negative discount line must not be treated as an arithmetic error. Guards against over-rejection."}
{"id": "adv_document_discount", "document": "adv_document_discount.txt", "expected_outcome": "fail", "expected_blocking_rules": ["line_items_sum_to_subtotal"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "AS-0154", "supplier": "Aldgate Signage Co.", "currency": "GBP", "issue_date": "2026-03-02", "subtotal": "1140.00", "tax": "228.00", "total": "1368.00"}, "notes": "The settlement discount sits below the line items. Captured lines sum to 1200.00, subtotal is 1140.00. Schema-valid, arithmetically incoherent."}
{"id": "adv_per_line_tax", "document": "adv_per_line_tax.txt", "expected_outcome": "fail", "expected_blocking_rules": ["line_item_arithmetic", "line_items_sum_to_subtotal"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "FE-2026-77", "supplier": "Fenwick Electrical Services", "currency": "GBP", "issue_date": "2026-01-14", "subtotal": "530.00", "tax": "106.00", "total": "636.00"}, "notes": "Per-line VAT columns. The model took the gross column as the line amount, so lines sum to 636.00 against a 530.00 subtotal."}
{"id": "adv_rounding_drift", "document": "adv_rounding_drift.txt", "expected_outcome": "needs_review", "expected_blocking_rules": ["subtotal_plus_tax_equals_total"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "LP-5521", "supplier": "Loxley Paper Mill", "currency": "EUR", "issue_date": "2026-02-23", "subtotal": "412.55", "tax": "78.38", "total": "490.94"}, "notes": "412.55 + 78.38 = 490.93, printed as 490.94. One minor unit of drift: a reviewer decides, not a hard reject."}
{"id": "adv_multipage_subtotal", "document": "adv_multipage_subtotal.txt", "expected_outcome": "validated", "expected_blocking_rules": [], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "TO-9012", "supplier": "Thornbury Office Fit-Out", "currency": "GBP", "issue_date": "2026-04-06", "subtotal": "5586.00", "tax": "1117.20", "total": "6703.20"}, "notes": "Line items split across a page break, totals only on page two. Correct extraction must carry all four lines."}
{"id": "adv_currency_mismatch", "document": "adv_currency_mismatch.txt", "expected_outcome": "needs_review", "expected_blocking_rules": ["currency_agrees_with_source"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "HM-4408", "supplier": "Havenport Marine Supply", "currency": null, "issue_date": "2026-03-11", "subtotal": "330.00", "tax": "66.00", "total": "396.00"}, "notes": "Header says USD, every amount is prefixed with a euro sign. The document contradicts itself; no extraction is correct."}
{"id": "adv_duplicate_number", "document": "adv_duplicate_number.txt", "expected_outcome": "fail", "expected_blocking_rules": ["invoice_number_not_duplicate"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "INV-2026-0001", "supplier": "ACME Supplies Ltd", "currency": "GBP", "issue_date": "2026-03-04", "subtotal": "423.00", "tax": "84.60", "total": "507.60"}, "notes": "A second delivery of INV-2026-0001. Every field is extracted correctly and the document must still be blocked."}
{"id": "adv_credit_note", "document": "adv_credit_note.txt", "expected_outcome": "validated", "expected_blocking_rules": [], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "CN-2026-0042", "supplier": "Bramley Produce Ltd", "currency": "GBP", "issue_date": "2026-03-30", "subtotal": "-180.00", "tax": "-36.00", "total": "-216.00"}, "notes": "A well-formed credit note. Negative totals are legitimate and must not be rejected on sign alone."}
{"id": "adv_credit_note_mis_signed", "document": "adv_credit_note_mis_signed.txt", "expected_outcome": "fail", "expected_blocking_rules": ["line_items_sum_to_subtotal", "credit_note_consistent"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "CN-2026-0051", "supplier": "Ravenscroft Textiles", "currency": "EUR", "issue_date": "2026-04-02", "subtotal": "-300.00", "tax": "-57.00", "total": "-357.00"}, "notes": "The credit note prints its line amount unsigned. A negative total with a positive line is not a coherent record."}
{"id": "adv_totals_dont_add", "document": "adv_totals_dont_add.txt", "expected_outcome": "fail", "expected_blocking_rules": ["subtotal_plus_tax_equals_total"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "WW-6120", "supplier": "Wellspring Water Services", "currency": "GBP", "issue_date": "2026-02-28", "subtotal": "255.00", "tax": "51.00", "total": null}, "notes": "The printed total is wrong on the document itself: 255.00 + 51.00 = 306.00. Faithful extraction of a wrong document."}
{"id": "adv_unsupported_currency", "document": "adv_unsupported_currency.txt", "expected_outcome": "fail", "expected_blocking_rules": ["supported_currency"], "difficulty": "hard", "ground_truth": {"invoice_number": "ZP-2026-018", "supplier": "Zurich Precision Instruments", "currency": "CHF", "issue_date": "2026-03-16", "subtotal": "640.00", "tax": "51.84", "total": "691.84"}, "notes": "Perfectly extracted, outside the supported currency set. Correct extraction is not authorization to write."}
